@@ -0,0 +1,13 @@
+# Web live bundle smoke
+
+This standalone Linux/Node smoke uses the changed app-boot source with installed rc2 Cordis/Loader/HMR peers. It does not replace the repository source-plane Vitest, typecheck, browser, or real CLI/pnpm acceptance suites.
+
+From the repository root:
+
+```sh
+TSX_TSCONFIG_PATH=$PWD/tsconfig.live-smoke.json node --import tsx/esm --test apps/cli/tests/live-bundles.smoke.ts
+```
+
+The checks exercise actual file watchers and a Loader Include: malformed user YAML during bundle installation, recovery, additive manifest discovery, new bundle configuration watches, explicit disable/enable, retention on removal or version change, no commit during prepare, quiescent in-flight refresh disposal, and disposal while registration opens. The final case gates watcher readiness around the real registration to make the race reproducible; it does not substitute a fake watcher.
+
+Not established: code HMR, byte-level integrity of transitive dependencies, active AutoReview cancellation safety, runtime CLI package-manager races, and browser graph arrival. These require separate acceptance before deployment.
